em upon the altar of the house of your God which [is] in Jerusalem."],"ref":"Ezra 7:17","verse":17,"words":[{"text":"That","strong":"H3606"},{"text":"","strong":"H6903"},{"text":" thou mayest buy","strong":"H7066"},{"text":" speedily","strong":"H629"},{"text":" with this","strong":"H1836"},{"text":" money","strong":"H3702"},{"text":" bullocks","strong":"H8450"},{"text":", rams","strong":"H1798"},{"text":", lambs","strong":"H563"},{"text":", with their meat offerings","strong":"H4504"},{"text":" and their drink offerings","strong":"H5261"},{"text":", and offer","strong":"H7127"},{"text":" them","strong":"H1994"},{"text":" upon","strong":"H5922"},{"text":" the altar","strong":"H4056"},{"text":" of the house","strong":"H1005"},{"text":" of your God","strong":"H426"},{"text":" which [is] in Jerusalem","strong":"H3390"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":12191,"title":"Ezra 7:18","segments":["And whatsoever shall seem good to thee, and to thy brethren, to do with the rest of the silver and the gold, that do after the will of your God."],"ref":"Ezra 7:18","verse":18,"words":[{"text":"And whatsoever","strong":"H4101"},{"text":"","strong":"H1768"},{"text":" shall seem good","strong":"H3191"},{"text":" to thee, and to","strong":"H5922"},{"text":" thy brethren","strong":"H252"},{"text":", to do","strong":"H5648"},{"text":" with the rest","strong":"H7606"},{"text":" of the silver","strong":"H3702"},{"text":" and the gold","strong":"H1722"},{"text":", that do","strong":"H5648"},{"text":" after the will","strong":"H7470"},{"text":" of your God","strong":"H426"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":12192,"title":"Ezra 7:19","segments":["The vessels also that are given thee for the service of the house of thy God, [those] deliver thou before the God of Jerusalem."],"ref":"Ezra 7:19","verse":19,"words":[{"text":"The vessels","strong":"H3984"},{"text":" also that are given","strong":"H3052"},{"text":" thee for the service","strong":"H6402"},{"text":" of the house","strong":"H1005"},{"text":" of thy God","strong"