":"H3820"},{"text":", to beautify","strong":"H6286"},{"text":" the house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":" of the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" which [is] in Jerusalem","strong":"H3389"},{"text":":"}]},{"id":12201,"title":"Ezra 7:28","segments":["And hath extended mercy unto me before the king, and his counsellors, and before all the king's mighty princes. And I was strengthened as the hand of the LORD my God [was] upon me, and I gathered together out of Israel chief men to go up with me."],"ref":"Ezra 7:28","verse":28,"words":[{"text":"And hath extended","strong":"H5186"},{"text":" mercy","strong":"H2617"},{"text":" unto me before","strong":"H6440"},{"text":" the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":", and his counsellors","strong":"H3289"},{"text":", and before all the king's","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" mighty","strong":"H1368"},{"text":" princes","strong":"H8269"},{"text":". And I was strengthened","strong":"H2388"},{"text":" as the hand","strong":"H3027"},{"text":" of the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" my God","strong":"H430"},{"text":" [was] upon me, and I gathered together","strong":"H6908"},{"text":" out of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":" chief men","strong":"H7218"},{"text":" to go up","strong":"H5927"},{"text":" with me."}]}]}
